MAQTAL MEIN KHO NA JAYE KAHEEN LAASHE BEPIDAR<br>
 ABBAS DEKHO LAASHA-E-QASIM KO EK NAZAR<br>
<br>
TAYGHON KI ZAD MEIN AAGAYA FARWA KA PISAR,<br>
 SEENE SE SHAHE DEEN KE NIKALTA HAI AB JIGAR,<br>
 WO GULBADAN KE SEHRE KI LADIYAN HAI KHOON ME TAR,<br>
 HAI JISM PARA PARA LAHO MEIN BHARA HAI SAR,<br>
 ABBAS DEKHO LAASHA-E-QASIM KO EK NAZAR<br>
<br>
PAUNCHE JO DONO LASHA-E-QASIM PE NOUHAGAR,<br>
 BIKHRE HUE THE TUKDE ZAMEEN PAR IDHAR UDHAR,<br>
 NAZROU MEIN PHIR RAHA THA WAHIN BHAI KA JIGAR,<br>
 APNI ABA BICHAHYE HAIN SHABBIR KHAAK PAR,<br>
 ABBAS DEKHO LAASHA-E-QASIM KO EK NAZAR<br>
<br>
PAMAAL HO KE HAYE GHAREEBUL WATAN GAYE,<br>
 MAQTAL SE TABA KHAIMA JO IBNE HASSAN GAYE,<br>
 ZAKHMON KE HAAR LE KE WO SHIREEN SUQAN GAYE,<br>
 DIL GHAM SE DOOBTA HAI KAHAN GULBADAN GAYE,<br>
 ABBAS DEKHO LAASHA-E-EQASIM KO EK NAZAR<br>
<br>
FIZZA BHI DIL JALI RAHI KHAIME MEIN NOUHAGAR,<br>
 FARWA NE SAR JHUKADIYA BETE KI LAASH PAR,<br>
 ZAINAB NE AAH SARD BHARI LAASH DEKHKAR,<br>
 KYA TUM KO MAIN BATAON KE PHAT TA HAI AB JIGAR,<br>
 ABBAS DEKHO LAASHA-E-QASIM KO EK NAZAR<br>
<br>
KUBRA BHI RAH NA PAYEGI DUNIYA MEIN CHAIN SE,<br>
 KARBO BALA DAHELTI HAI ZEHRA KE BAIN SE, <br>
HUSHIYAAR MERE LAAL SHAHE MASHREQAIN SE,<br>
 MAYYAT UTHEGI KAISE BHALA AB HUSSAIN SE,<br>
 ABBAS DEKHO LAASHA-E-QASIM KO EK NAZAR